The adult's dSPM gain for << F.loc_strength_high_nam >>-nAm patches depended on the implementation: << F.loc_adult_dense_vs_combined_patch320_dspm_diff_mm >> mm (p = << F.loc_adult_dense_vs_combined_patch320_dspm_p >>) with the study's estimator and << F.loc_adult_dense_vs_combined_patch320_dspm_mne_diff_mm >> mm (p = << F.loc_adult_dense_vs_combined_patch320_dspm_mne_p >>) with MNE-Python's. Joint success assumes the event time is known, because localization is read at the true peak sample.

